{"id":"vod_zy360_66034","vodId":"66034","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"田中君总是如此慵懒","name_cn":"田中君总是如此慵懒","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241018-1/5cffec32d07b5600d9bcda81b8b7d13e.jpg"},"summary":"田中（小野贤章配音）是1-F班的学生，身体孱弱的他长着一副宛如女孩子般的秀气面孔，讲起话来亦细声细语，还常常讲到一半就因为体力不支而睡着。无论何时，田中都是一副迷迷糊糊的困倦模样，生活中任何麻烦的事情都和他无缘。长相有些凶恶的太田（细谷佳正配音）常常被人误认为是不良少年，但实际上，他却担任着田中身边“保姆”的职责，在生活之中对他照顾有加并且乐在其中。活泼开朗的元气少女宫野（高森奈津美配音）一直暗恋着大姐头越前（诹访彩花配音），为了能够成为和越前相配的同伴，宫野拜了田中为师，向他学习稳重慵懒之道。充满了欢乐的日常就此展开。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-10-18 14:08:32","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/nwS1NaXB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/JOEGGegR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/i1lidP0d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/kcbui2Ad/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/eywFR2o4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/chEs90DA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/KmAIld7V/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/V8zZytEq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/ZUz73sgv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/QgNPZj4X/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/hEGVEAZt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/lxHPZKbA/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:02.415Z"}